  "notes": {
    "title": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "text": "Lovinity — redesign",
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 1800
    },
    "why": {
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "fill": "orange",
      "size": "s",
      "text": "Direction\n\n• Dark hero, one lit color: gold. Depth comes from surface steps (#0A0A0A → #141414 → #1C1A16), not gradients.\n• Each person keeps one color everywhere: you = gold, your spouse = rose. Paired pips, avatars, chat bubbles and the tasbih ring all use it.\n• Home replaces the 12-card stack with one hero (next prayer + today's shared pips) and a Deen / Us / Home switcher that reaches all 18 features in one tap.\n• Every motion has a cause: the ring counts down live, pips fill when a prayer is logged, tiles rise when you switch groups. Reduced motion turns it all off.\n• Type unchanged: Space Grotesk display, Inter body, Amiri for Arabic.\n\nPress Play on any frame: tabs, toggles, the tasbih and checklists work, and tiles link between screens."
    }
  },
